      "created_at": "2015-03-15T16:52:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We have had villain beatdown's before, but this one is based on <a href=\"http://x.gray.org/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-difficulty-scores.html\">Gray's fantastic analysis of the stats</a>. For this match, if you win a game, put all the info in <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1FuWwDxQawlLdhRKMiDQKB-07s-Y-Zi-5nalDlOvqiiA/viewform\">this form.</a>&nbsp;Based on the villain, heroes, and environment you will be given a score based on the difficulty of the macthup, a higher score, the more difficult the match. The goal of this event is to score as many points as possible. If you need help figuring out how many points your match will give, you can use <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1xsT9PNLceMkXkf4LiV9AcDvIRrAQMUu5kCgs7cVjihc/edit?usp=sharing\">this spreadsheet</a>. Just select the info from the drop down menu, and it will get you toyr score. I don't mind if you use my sheet, but you can also copy it for yourself.</p><p>If you submit a game that passes a checkpoint, please tell me the row number of that game. I will keep track of how long ti takes to get to each checkpoint.</p><p><span>Links</span></p><p><a href=\"http://x.gray.org/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-difficulty-scores.html\"><span>Gray's Analysis</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1FuWwDxQawlLdhRKMiDQKB-07s-Y-Zi-5nalDlOvqiiA/viewform\"><span>Submission Form</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1cRE2wlLfr5ELdbDAfavOZfpneVm_SyHq4Ia8MNrIKuo/edit?usp=sharing\"><span>Points and Leaderboard</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1xsT9PNLceMkXkf4LiV9AcDvIRrAQMUu5kCgs7cVjihc/edit?usp=sharing\"><span>Match Point Determination</span></a></p>",
