      "created_at": "2015-03-16T22:46:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hmmmm...I am thinking this might be too restrictive. Not that it is hard, but there aren't a real lot of combinations that give a good score, especially if you don't like some heroes/villains. So, to make things a bit easier, I am adding 50 points to each score. This should give some more choices, and still give a high number for the really difficult games.</p>",
